.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt OSSL_LIB_CTX_SET_CONF_DIAGNOSTICS 3ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm OSSL_LIB_CTX_set_conf_diagnostics ,
.Nm OSSL_LIB_CTX_get_conf_diagnostics
.Nd Set and get configuration diagnostics
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/crypto.h
.Ft void
.Fo OSSL_LIB_CTX_set_conf_diagnostics
.Fa "OSSL_LIB_CTX *ctx"
.Fa "int value"
.Fc
.Ft int
.Fo OSSL_LIB_CTX_get_conf_diagnostics
.Fa "OSSL_LIB_CTX *ctx"
.Fc
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Fn OSSL_LIB_CTX_set_conf_diagnostics
sets the value of the configuration diagnostics flag.
If
.Fa value
is nonzero subsequent parsing and application of configuration data can
report errors that would otherwise be ignored.
In particular any errors in the ssl configuration module will cause a
failure of
.Xr SSL_CTX_new 3
and
.Xr SSL_CTX_new_ex 3
calls.
The configuration diagnostics flag can be also set when a configuration
file is being loaded into
.Vt OSSL_LIB_CTX
with
.Xr OSSL_LIB_CTX_load_config 3 .
If the configuration sets a
.Sy config_diagnostics
value as described in
.Xr config 5 ,
it will override the value set by
.Fn OSSL_LIB_CTX_set_conf_diagnostics
before loading the configuration file.
.Pp
.Fn OSSL_LIB_CTX_get_conf_diagnostics
returns the current value of the configuration diagnostics flag.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
.Fn OSSL_LIB_CTX_get_conf_diagnostics
returns 0 if the configuration diagnostics should not be performed,
nonzero otherwise.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr SSL_CTX_new 3 ,
.Xr OSSL_LIB_CTX_load_config 3 ,
.Xr config 5
.Sh HISTORY
The functions described on this page were added in OpenSSL 3.4.
